50966354,"text":"おやまあ、私はそんな意地悪な長老じゃないワ。","nextNodeIds":[737020620]},{"nodeId":737020620,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13210,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":835864274,"text":"あ、そうだ。勇者の責務については…まだ花冠から関連知識を得られていマセン…","nextNodeIds":[737020621]},{"nodeId":737020621,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13210,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":558835394,"text":"私がまだ勇者として未熟だからでしょうカ？もしかして、ほかの訓練を受ける必要が…","nextNodeIds":[737020622]},{"nodeId":737020622,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4284,"speakerName":"ズルヴァーン","textMapHash":1061131186,"text":"そうネェ…確かに勇者の称号は花霊の伝統の一部だけれど、その責務は時代とともに変わるものヨ。","nextNodeIds":[737020623]},{"nodeId":737020623,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13210,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":3518153778,"text":"ハイ。","nextNodeIds":[737020624]},{"nodeId":737020624,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4284,"speakerName":"ズルヴァーン","textMapHash":947165058,"text":"簡潔に言えばネ、具体的に何をすべきか、どんな基準で合否が判断されるのか、決まった規則はないの。通常、霊光の決定が最終的な判断になる。","nextNodeIds":[737020625]},{"nodeId":737020625,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13210,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":2990957914,"text":"えっ？ということは…","nextNodeIds":[737020626]},{"nodeId":737020626,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4284,"speakerName":"ズルヴァーン","textMapHash":2745701530,"text":"私が「二本角の花冠」を没収するなんてコトはないワ。","nextNodeIds":[737020627,737020629]},{"nodeId":737020627,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4088799578,"text":"頭頂部が寒くなるのを心配せずにすむね。","nextNodeIds":[737020628]},{"nodeId":737020628,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2819584618,"text":"ポイントが違うだろ！","nextNodeIds":[737020633]},{"nodeId":737020633,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13210,"speakerName":"ソルシュ","textMapHash":99551482,"text":"分かったワ！これもテストのうちなのネ。","nextNodeIds":[737020634]},{"nodeId":737020634,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":771202282,"text":"ソルシュ、何が分かったんだ？","nextNodeIds":[737020635]},{"nodeId":73